        <tr id="comment-body-6626167"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <h1><a name="Generatingmonitoringlink%28OldWay%29"></a>Generating monitoring link (Old Way)</h1>

<p>UI code <a href="https://gitlab.nebius.dev/nebius/nebo/-/blob/trunk/ui/apps/ydb-ui/src/ui/services/monitoring.ts?ref_type=heads" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://gitlab.nebius.dev/nebius/nebo/-/blob/trunk/ui/apps/ydb-ui/src/ui/services/monitoring.ts?ref_type=heads</a></p>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>{
  "monitoring_url": "https://grafana.example.com",
  "serverless_dashboard": "user-dashboard-serverless",
  "dedicated_dashboard": "user-dashboard-dedicated",
  "cluster_dashboard": "cluster-overview",
  "params": {
    "orgId": "1",
    "var-ds": "b0269287-b776-4e5e-b980-7a731fe272e8",
    "var-workspace": "ydb-global"
  }
}</pre>
</div></div>

<h3><a name="Clusterlink"></a>Cluster link</h3>

<ul>
	<li>The base URL is <tt>monitoring_url</tt>.</li>
	<li>The path segment is appended using <tt>cluster_dashboard</tt>.</li>
	<li>All fields from <tt>params</tt> are added as query parameters.</li>
	<li>The following defaults are added:
	<ul>
		<li><tt>from = now-24h</tt></li>
		<li><tt>to = now</tt></li>
	</ul>
	</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Example result:</b></p>

<p><a href="https://grafana.example.com/cluster-overview?orgId=1&amp;var-ds=b0269287-b776-4e5e-b980-7a731fe272e8&amp;var-workspace=ydb-global&amp;from=now-24h&amp;to=now" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://grafana.example.com/cluster-overview?orgId=1&amp;var-ds=b0269287-b776-4e5e-b980-7a731fe272e8&amp;var-workspace=ydb-global&amp;from=now-24h&amp;to=now</a></p>

<hr />

<h3><a name="Databaselink"></a>Database link</h3>

<ul>
	<li>The base URL is <tt>monitoring_url</tt>.</li>
	<li>The path segment is appended using:
	<ul>
		<li><tt>dedicated_dashboard</tt> for dedicated databases.</li>
		<li><tt>serverless_dashboard</tt> for serverless databases.</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
	<li>All fields from <tt>params</tt> are added as query parameters.</li>
	<li>An additional parameter is added:
	<ul>
		<li><tt>var-database = &lt;database name&gt;</tt></li>
	</ul>
	</li>
	<li>The following defaults are added:
	<ul>
		<li><tt>from = now-24h</tt></li>
		<li><tt>to = now</tt></li>
	</ul>
	</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Example result:</b></p>

<p><a href="https://grafana.example.com/user-dashboard-serverless?orgId=1&amp;var-ds=b0269287-b776-4e5e-b980-7a731fe272e8&amp;var-workspace=ydb-global&amp;var-database=%2Ftesting-global%2Fcompute-api-shadow&amp;from=now-24h&amp;to=now" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://grafana.example.com/user-dashboard-serverless?orgId=1&amp;var-ds=b0269287-b776-4e5e-b980-7a731fe272e8&amp;var-workspace=ydb-global&amp;var-database=%2Ftesting-global%2Fcompute-api-shadow&amp;from=now-24h&amp;to=now</a></p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-6626408"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            Комментарий по  
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="712020:9b6f6940-7c5c-486d-b283-abfb0ef8b2e7"
