        <tr id="comment-body-6921826"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p><a href="https://nebius.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A9b6f6940-7c5c-486d-b283-abfb0ef8b2e7" class="user-hover" rel="712020:9b6f6940-7c5c-486d-b283-abfb0ef8b2e7" data-account-id="712020:9b6f6940-7c5c-486d-b283-abfb0ef8b2e7" accountid="712020:9b6f6940-7c5c-486d-b283-abfb0ef8b2e7" rel="noreferrer">Alexander Smirnov</a> <a href="https://nebius.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A24a48bb5-cfef-4c77-bd16-b3b4f81c5b4e" class="user-hover" rel="712020:24a48bb5-cfef-4c77-bd16-b3b4f81c5b4e" data-account-id="712020:24a48bb5-cfef-4c77-bd16-b3b4f81c5b4e" accountid="712020:24a48bb5-cfef-4c77-bd16-b3b4f81c5b4e" rel="noreferrer">Vladislav Kuznecov</a> I’ve updated the description based on our discussion last Thursday. Please take a quick look if you get a chance.</p>

<p>Main changes:</p>

<ul>
	<li>Link definitions are now in the Meta configuration.</li>
	<li>Placeholders for tag-based links are used in the params field.</li>
	<li>The Grafana instance URL is also moved to the configuration.</li>
</ul>

