        <tr id="comment-body-6935969"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p><a href="https://nebius.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A8b69336d-51ba-4e44-920f-ddf22872c09f" class="user-hover" rel="712020:8b69336d-51ba-4e44-920f-ddf22872c09f" data-account-id="712020:8b69336d-51ba-4e44-920f-ddf22872c09f" accountid="712020:8b69336d-51ba-4e44-920f-ddf22872c09f" rel="noreferrer">Andrei Rykov</a> Looks like nothing is changing in comparison to the existing UI, where I see the same ‘Monitoring’ link. Then what are we going to do?</p>
