        <tr id="comment-body-7044599"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p><a href="https://nebius.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A9b6f6940-7c5c-486d-b283-abfb0ef8b2e7" class="user-hover" rel="712020:9b6f6940-7c5c-486d-b283-abfb0ef8b2e7" data-account-id="712020:9b6f6940-7c5c-486d-b283-abfb0ef8b2e7" accountid="712020:9b6f6940-7c5c-486d-b283-abfb0ef8b2e7" rel="noreferrer">Alexander Smirnov</a> please check the 5th option</p>

<p><b>Option 5. The same like in Grafana when user clicks on "other dashboards"</b></p>

<h3><a name="Steps%3A"></a>Steps:</h3>
<ol>
	<li>User goes to the cluster page.</li>
	<li>UI performs the initial render and shows a page-level loading spinner.</li>
	<li>UI sends Grafana request on page load.</li>
	<li>UI waits for Grafana response or timeout to complete.<br/>
<b>Successful Grafana load:</b></li>
	<li>UI shows the page. It shows legacy static links, grafana static links + label of tag (see pictures below). Optional: the number of known dashboards.</li>
	<li>User hovers label of tag.</li>
	<li>UI shows pop-up.</li>
	<li>Pop-up shows Grafana tag-based links with filled parameters (ds, workspace, etc).<br/>
<b>Failed Grafana load:</b></li>
	<li>UI shows the page. It shows legacy static links, grafana static links.</li>
	<li>UI show a warning such as “Failed to load Grafana dashboards”.
<h3><a name="Pros"></a>Pros</h3></li>
</ol>
<ul>
	<li>No UI layout shifts.</li>
	<li>UI shows Grafana tag-based links like in Grafana itself in one space.
<h3><a name="Cons"></a>Cons</h3></li>
	<li>Higher frontend complexity.</li>
	<li>Unused request if user never opens Grafana badge.
<h2><a name="UIExamples"></a><b>UI Examples</b></h2>
<p>Below are examples of tag-based Grafana links for cluster links and database links. The preferred option is listed first.</p></li>
</ul>
<ol>
	<li>Cluster links<br/>
<span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/852216" alt="Screenshot 2025-11-12 at 18.28.26 (6).png" width="358" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span><br/>
<span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/852099" alt="Screenshot 2025-11-12 at 18.28.26 (3).png" width="360" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span><br/>
<span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/852214" alt="Screenshot 2025-11-12 at 18.28.26 (4).png" width="362" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></li>
	<li>Database links (Cluster page)<br/>
<span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/852389" alt="Screenshot 2025-11-13 at 11.04.21 (1).png" width="328" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span><br/>
In the alternative option, second popup is expected to appear (The complexity is unknown.)<br/>
<span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/852388" alt="Screenshot 2025-11-13 at 11.04.21.png" width="333" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></li>
	<li>Database links (Database Info page)<br/>
<span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/852417" alt="Screenshot 2025-11-13 at 11.33.17.png" width="314" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></li>
</ol>

        </td></tr>
